msgid "Mollie offers the possibility to register payers as a customer within the Mollie payment platform. This functionality remembers payment preferences to make future payments easier. The Mollie customers can be linked to WordPress users. This is a list of Mollie customers associated with this WordPress user. For subscriptions, a Mollie customer mandate can be used for recurring payments."
